an and routed affine products; adds the pick, relu^2,\nlocal-id and sum kernels.\n\ntf_nemo_select_rank ranks each expert by the experts before it (a higher sigmoid score plus bias, or an equal one at\na lower id), four lanes counting an expert of 128, and writes the bytes of the pass that picks one at a time; that\npass stays as the kernel test's reference. Kernel tests against float64, the row byte contract and broken variants,\nand the ranked pick against the one-at-a-time pass over random and tied logits, 32 to 1000 experts, top 6 to 32 and\n1 to 64 rows.\n\nThe five kernels register with the kernel contract: both picks by their stated rule, the rank pick bit-equal to\nthe pass, relu^2, and the sum in the activation type and in fp32. relu^2 keeps a NaN NaN, as torch's relu does.","timestamp":"2026-10-20T00:00:30Z","author":{"name":"BlivionIaG","email":"15323295+BlivionIaG@users.noreply.github.com"},"committer":{"name":"BlivionIaG","email":"15323295+BlivionIaG@users.noreply.github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1274723381,"node_id":"R_kgDOS_q8NQ","name":"TensorFold","full_name":"ashhart/TensorFold","private":false,"owner":{"login":"ashhart","id":71890694,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODkwNjk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71890694?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart","html_url":"https://github.com/ashhart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/received_events",